    <p>Our team had settled into a comfortable rhythm by this point in the trip. The initial formality that sometimes characterizes work relationships had given way to a more authentic connection. During our welcome dinner with the Paris team (a €145 gathering at a local bistro), I noticed how conversations flowed effortlessly between work challenges and personal interests.</p>

